error[E0450]: cannot prove lemma `wrong`
  --> forall_ensures.ck:29:13
   |
29 |     ensures forall m : m~Int, m > 0
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `forall m : m~Int, m > 0`
   = note: counterexample: m = 0
   = help: add a `proof` block: `match` on a parameter for case analysis, and `have` for facts it needs

error[E0289]: this lemma would have to show a `forall` false, which takes a value it fails for
  --> forall_ensures.ck:33:17
   |
33 |     ensures not (forall m : m~Int, m > 0)
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a `forall` before `implies` or under `not`
